Subject: [PATCH] ASoC: expose SM-G955N handset receiver playback

Keep the existing SM-G955N speaker and microphone PCM numbering.
Add the stock handset codec endpoint on AIF1 via UAIF0 and SIFS1.
The two playback links share RDMA0 and are selected by separate UCM
verbs. Serialize playback preparation and restore only the route
fields owned by each output. Reference-count the UAIF0 clock and
format shared with WDMA1 capture. Require the receiver DMA to move
before its PCM trigger returns success.

Apply to the native R100 source through audio patch 0125.

diff --git a/sound/soc/samsung/g955n-abox-speaker.c b/sound/soc/samsung/g955n-abox-speaker.c
--- a/sound/soc/samsung/g955n-abox-speaker.c
+++ b/sound/soc/samsung/g955n-abox-speaker.c
